zΔ⚡b|=f9b|-2|+These are|=1|-1|+l|=1|-1|+n|=d|+not changed |=1|+etw|=4|-1|+the tw|=1|-2|+ |=2|+l|=1|-1|+s|=2|-5|=1|-3|+nd|=1|-2|+s|=1|-4|=5|-3|+be |=1|+sed as a |=2|+ference|=1|+t|=1|-1|+ loca|=1|+e|=1|-1|+t|=2|-1|+ chunk's place in a modifi|=1|+d file and find|=b2|-2|=2b7|+.  A number range appearing between sets of three asterisks applies to the original file, while sets of three dashes apply to the new file.  The chunk ranges specify the starting line number and the number of lines the change hunk applies to in the respective file|=3906|
